{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026aBHguCRhhW1793110193.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>[21:42更新]</p><p>水務署：筲箕灣、部分西灣河用戶食水供應晚上九時半起陸續恢復正常。</p><p></p><p>[早前報道]</p><p>晚飯過後在東大街的水車位置，仍有不少人排隊取水，水務署亦有派大樽裝水，附近有餐廳繼續營業，職員指晚上8時許開始有水，但水弱且黃，所以繼續在外取水，又稱生意較平日好，由於當區之前都試過停水，已有方法應對。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BURST.NIGHT-2130_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026dHHL7PDmlk1793110211.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>至於「爆水管」的位置至晚上9時許，已大致修補好。損毀部分已換走。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T14:21:39.241281+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T13:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T16:58:20.745142+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T14:18:36.685562+00:00","content_hash":"bd60cb8ecdc8e24b76455fef7687bd7090cb30c3e3c175f58c5c176f80a20f7b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}